WEBVTT

00:06.880 --> 00:09.380
[♪ theme music playing]

01:37.590 --> 01:39.840
[sobbing]

01:42.470 --> 01:44.470
[♪ somber music]

01:45.930 --> 01:48.270
-[Souya sobbing]
-[chuckles]

01:48.350 --> 01:50.310
Don't cry, Souya.

01:53.690 --> 01:56.740
[Smiley] I'll find a way to handle things
on my own from now on.

01:59.320 --> 02:02.780
So promise me you'll never cry again.

02:03.790 --> 02:04.790
Okay?

02:07.290 --> 02:08.710
[Mitsuya] Hey, Smiley.

02:10.130 --> 02:11.290
What's wrong?

02:11.750 --> 02:13.090
You're spacing out.

02:14.130 --> 02:17.470
Oh, I was just remembering something.

02:17.550 --> 02:18.550
Remembering what?

02:19.220 --> 02:24.010
He's been following after me
ever since then.

02:26.930 --> 02:29.640
I sure hope Angry's okay on his own.

02:30.190 --> 02:32.060
What if he cries again?

02:32.650 --> 02:33.940
You're way too protective.

02:36.780 --> 02:38.240
[Mitsuya] Don't you worry.

02:38.950 --> 02:40.450
They are tough.

02:41.410 --> 02:42.490
[Smiley] Yeah.

02:43.530 --> 02:44.870
That's true, but...

02:46.160 --> 02:47.160
Huh?

02:47.910 --> 02:50.080
[both shouting]

02:51.830 --> 02:52.960
[grunts]

02:55.590 --> 02:59.220
[Souya] <i>Smiley could have
easily broken this tackle.</i>

02:59.590 --> 03:01.380
Your leg goes next.

03:02.050 --> 03:03.890
Time to snap it!
[grunts]

03:04.970 --> 03:06.060
-Angry!
-[bone snaps]

03:06.140 --> 03:08.600
[groaning]

03:09.180 --> 03:10.810
[chuckles]
Love that sound.

03:11.770 --> 03:13.520
How thrilling.

03:13.610 --> 03:16.730
[groaning continues]

03:17.690 --> 03:22.320
I busted his right arm and left leg,
so this loser's out of it.

03:22.410 --> 03:23.700
Now,

03:24.870 --> 03:27.870
you're all on your own, Hakkai.

03:27.950 --> 03:29.370
[panting]

03:30.540 --> 03:32.830
What kind of torment would you like?

03:32.920 --> 03:34.580
-[gasps]
-[loud thwack]

03:34.670 --> 03:36.040
[Hakkai grunts]

03:36.130 --> 03:38.000
[groaning]

03:38.590 --> 03:40.970
[Souya] <i>I'm sorry, Hakkai.</i>

03:41.590 --> 03:43.680
Nice. Hold him there like that.

03:43.760 --> 03:45.430
Don't!

03:45.510 --> 03:46.510
[grunts]

03:46.600 --> 03:48.060
That's not fair!

03:49.220 --> 03:50.390
[loud thwack]

03:50.480 --> 03:52.270
-[whimpers]
-[loud thwack]

03:53.350 --> 03:54.520
[all grunting]

03:54.600 --> 03:58.230
You're no match for me. You damn punk!

03:58.320 --> 04:00.240
[breathes heavily]

04:00.320 --> 04:04.070
The only thing I'll grant you is
that you're not just some gorilla.

04:04.160 --> 04:05.410
-[grunts]
-[loud thwack]

04:05.490 --> 04:06.570
[both gasp]

04:09.790 --> 04:10.870
Hakkai!

04:11.250 --> 04:14.170
[grunting]

04:15.750 --> 04:17.590
[whimpers]

04:18.500 --> 04:19.500
Hakkai!

04:20.090 --> 04:21.760
-[loud thwack]
-[Hakkai groaning]

04:22.550 --> 04:26.180
[indistinct chatter]

04:26.840 --> 04:28.050
-[loud thwack]
-[Hakkai gasps]

04:28.140 --> 04:29.430
[Souya] <i>He'll die.</i>

04:30.720 --> 04:32.100
<i>If this keeps up,</i>

04:32.890 --> 04:34.770
<i>Hakkai will die!</i>

04:34.850 --> 04:38.110
[throbbing heartbeats]

04:38.190 --> 04:40.360
-[thwacking continues]
-[mocking laughter]

04:40.440 --> 04:41.780
-[Souya whimpers]
-[loud thwack]

04:41.860 --> 04:44.820
[Souya wails]

04:47.870 --> 04:52.750
Cut it out, you meanies!

04:54.330 --> 04:56.370
Whoa, are you serious?

04:56.460 --> 04:57.630
Pathetic.

04:57.710 --> 05:00.380
[wailing continues]

05:00.460 --> 05:02.630
[Smiley] <i>He's just so damn kind</i>

05:03.300 --> 05:05.800
that he can't punch anyone
like he means it.

05:05.880 --> 05:07.050
[laughs]

05:07.840 --> 05:09.680
Sounds like Angry.

05:10.050 --> 05:13.680
But things are different
when he starts crying.

05:14.560 --> 05:15.560
[Mitsuya] Huh?

05:17.230 --> 05:19.110
[Smiley] <i>His restraints come off</i>

05:20.650 --> 05:21.860
<i>and he becomes a demon.</i>

05:23.990 --> 05:24.990
A demon?

05:25.780 --> 05:30.700
Back in fourth grade, I was jumped
by a gang of middle-schoolers.

05:31.490 --> 05:34.290
When he saw that, he started crying.

05:34.700 --> 05:38.290
When I woke up, they were all
so badly hurt, they went to the hospital.

05:38.370 --> 05:39.460
[gasps]

05:39.540 --> 05:41.290
Angry did that?

05:41.380 --> 05:42.420
Yeah.

05:43.090 --> 05:46.220
Something similar had happened
before that too.

05:46.840 --> 05:50.640
But the brutality of the demon
inside him had got even worse since then.

05:51.010 --> 05:56.430
So I made him promise
to never, ever cry again.

05:57.390 --> 06:00.100
[Smiley] <i>If things go too far,
then it won't end well.</i>

06:02.610 --> 06:04.110
I'm sorry, Smiley.

06:04.900 --> 06:08.200
I broke my promise.

06:09.360 --> 06:10.780
What's with him?

06:11.120 --> 06:14.290
How can he walk with a busted leg?

06:17.410 --> 06:18.460
[snickers]

06:18.790 --> 06:20.580
When he cries,

06:21.580 --> 06:23.750
<i>he's 100 times stronger than me.</i>

06:25.130 --> 06:27.470
Hey, man. Don't overdo it.

06:27.550 --> 06:30.640
Your right arm
and left leg are broken, dude.

06:31.890 --> 06:34.850
Angry, don't do it.

06:36.350 --> 06:37.680
They'll kill you.

06:38.180 --> 06:40.190
[indistinct murmuring]

06:41.150 --> 06:42.190
[grunts]

06:42.270 --> 06:43.900
Guess I've got no choice.

06:44.860 --> 06:47.820
[Rindo] I'll just have to
bust another limb.

06:47.900 --> 06:50.740
Rindo, don't carelessly approach him.

06:50.860 --> 06:52.740
Don't you worry, Ran.

06:52.820 --> 06:55.120
He can't move properly anyway!

06:55.910 --> 06:57.540
[Rindo] <i>See? Piece of cake.</i>

06:57.660 --> 07:01.540
[grunting]

07:03.040 --> 07:04.130
He won't move.

07:04.840 --> 07:07.170
[groaning]

07:07.800 --> 07:10.880
The last time I cried was in fourth grade.

07:10.970 --> 07:12.800
[♪ somber music]

07:12.890 --> 07:14.220
[Souya] <i>When I came to,</i>

07:17.520 --> 07:19.140
<i>they were all on the ground.</i>

07:21.440 --> 07:23.020
[Smiley] Aw, man.

07:23.100 --> 07:26.230
[sobbing]

07:26.320 --> 07:28.570
[♪ somber music]

07:32.410 --> 07:33.910
Smiley told me,

07:34.530 --> 07:36.990
"Don't you dare ever cry again."

07:37.910 --> 07:39.160
"If you cry again..."

07:39.750 --> 07:41.710
Rindo, get away from him.

07:42.750 --> 07:44.670
"You'll end up killing someone."

07:44.750 --> 07:45.880
Rindo!

07:45.960 --> 07:47.000
[grunts]

07:49.210 --> 07:52.130
[all gasping]

07:58.640 --> 08:00.100
[gasps]

08:02.600 --> 08:04.480
-[gang members exclaim]
-[Ran] <i>Where'd he go?</i>

08:04.560 --> 08:05.560
[Souya] Too slow,

08:05.650 --> 08:06.900
braid boy.

08:06.980 --> 08:08.150
[Ran grunts]

08:08.940 --> 08:10.490
[gang members muttering]

08:11.150 --> 08:13.150
[♪ ominous music]

08:15.410 --> 08:17.030
[gang members exclaiming]

08:17.580 --> 08:20.370
[gang member] The Haitani Brothers
went down in an instant!

08:21.790 --> 08:23.920
[Mocchi] Hold on here one damn second!

08:24.000 --> 08:26.460
Mocchi, we're not done fighting!

08:26.540 --> 08:28.460
You got to be kidding, Haitani!

08:28.540 --> 08:32.090
How the hell could you lose
with your methods?

08:32.170 --> 08:33.170
Huh?

08:33.760 --> 08:38.260
[Mocchi] Aren't you that little punk
whose ass I kicked once already?

08:39.810 --> 08:43.480
What kind of trick did you pull
on these guys, huh?

08:44.390 --> 08:46.440
[gang members mutter]

08:47.730 --> 08:48.730
[exclaims]

08:49.110 --> 08:50.190
Mocchi?

08:54.240 --> 08:58.320
No way. Is that really you, Angry?

09:00.580 --> 09:03.250
Who wants some next?

09:03.870 --> 09:05.750
[all shouting]

09:05.830 --> 09:07.540
You got to be kidding!

09:07.630 --> 09:09.630
He... He's a monster!

09:12.170 --> 09:13.460
[Mucho] I get it now.

09:14.050 --> 09:15.300
[gang members exclaim]

09:15.380 --> 09:18.140
So, you're Toman's dark horse.

09:19.140 --> 09:20.260
[Souya] Mucho.

09:20.930 --> 09:23.770
I won't go easy on you, Souya.

09:26.060 --> 09:27.100
Die!

09:27.980 --> 09:30.400
[groans]

09:30.480 --> 09:31.650
[both gasp]

09:31.730 --> 09:34.610
[retching]

09:36.070 --> 09:37.570
Even Mucho?

09:38.280 --> 09:40.910
What the hell's gotten into you, Angry?

09:40.990 --> 09:43.450
[♪ ominous music]

09:44.700 --> 09:46.210
[snickers]

09:48.500 --> 09:49.710
[chuckles]

09:50.420 --> 09:51.960
[Takemichi gasps]

09:52.710 --> 09:55.590
[Takemichi] <i>Angry took down
nearly half of Tenjiku all by himself.</i>

09:59.050 --> 10:01.640
[gasping for air]

10:05.100 --> 10:06.430
[Mucho] Mikey.

10:07.100 --> 10:09.770
There's something
that I cannot ever give up.

10:10.940 --> 10:12.110
We're still...

10:12.480 --> 10:13.610
[Mikey] Save it, Mucho.

10:14.820 --> 10:15.820
Don't tell me everything.

10:17.610 --> 10:18.990
Even so,

10:19.910 --> 10:21.200
I still need you.

10:21.280 --> 10:22.370
[soft grunt]

10:22.450 --> 10:23.530
[gasps]

10:24.910 --> 10:27.370
[Chifuyu] That was kick-ass, Angry!

10:27.460 --> 10:28.830
Did you see that, Takemitchy?

10:29.250 --> 10:30.670
What the heck just happened?

10:30.750 --> 10:31.920
[Mucho gasps]

10:32.000 --> 10:33.170
[Mucho] <i>Did I...</i>

10:35.960 --> 10:37.380
<i>Did we</i>

10:39.010 --> 10:40.090
<i>just lose?</i>

10:41.430 --> 10:43.100
[Takemichi] Can you stand, Hakkai?

10:43.970 --> 10:45.060
[Hakkai] Yeah.

10:46.890 --> 10:49.140
What is that guy?

10:49.230 --> 10:51.400
He wiped out our Big Four just like that.

10:51.480 --> 10:54.110
Isn't he the other half
of the former Twin Devils?

10:54.190 --> 10:56.030
I didn't know he was so strong!

10:57.690 --> 10:58.740
Takemitchy.

11:00.490 --> 11:01.700
Angry.

11:03.280 --> 11:04.660
[Souya] This battle,

11:05.830 --> 11:06.830
we're going to win it!

11:07.330 --> 11:08.370
-Yeah!
-Yeah!

11:10.330 --> 11:11.460
[Takemichi] <i>That's right.</i>

11:12.580 --> 11:17.050
<i>There's no way we can lose
to these guys... to these bastards!</i>

11:20.260 --> 11:23.260
<i>I swear that future will never...</i>

11:23.340 --> 11:25.550
[♪ dramatic music]

11:31.560 --> 11:33.100
<i>Izana Kurokawa.</i>

11:34.610 --> 11:35.940
<i>Tetta Kisaki.</i>

11:37.480 --> 11:39.360
<i>Even if I die here,</i>

11:40.030 --> 11:42.360
<i>I swear I will stop you!</i>

11:44.570 --> 11:47.240
[panting]

11:50.750 --> 11:55.040
[Izana] How does it feel
to wear a new uniform?

11:56.090 --> 11:57.170
Not bad.

11:57.960 --> 12:03.880
For the first time, all the guys
of the Vicious Generation are in one gang.

12:05.010 --> 12:06.140
Yeah.

12:06.720 --> 12:08.560
Our kid fights end today.

12:09.560 --> 12:11.390
After crushing Toman,

12:11.730 --> 12:15.810
I'll take all you guys
to even higher heights.

12:16.940 --> 12:19.070
So make this gang your place.

12:19.820 --> 12:21.820
And be as vicious

12:21.900 --> 12:23.110
as you want to be.

12:26.410 --> 12:27.490
[gasps]

12:30.410 --> 12:32.620
[Mucho breathes deeply]
Hold it!

12:32.710 --> 12:34.080
[all gasp]

12:35.880 --> 12:36.880
[Takemichi] <i>Huh?</i>

12:37.710 --> 12:38.840
[gasps]

12:38.920 --> 12:40.210
[♪ tense music]

12:40.300 --> 12:41.300
A knife!

12:41.760 --> 12:43.590
[Mucho breathes raggedly]

12:43.670 --> 12:45.380
[Mucho] It's not over.

12:46.890 --> 12:48.550
I won't let it end.

12:50.100 --> 12:51.310
There's no way

12:53.230 --> 12:55.270
I will let it end.

13:00.110 --> 13:02.490
It hasn't even started.

13:03.070 --> 13:06.160
We're just getting rolling.

13:07.160 --> 13:08.530
Our time...

13:10.030 --> 13:13.950
I won't let your generation crush us!

13:15.120 --> 13:16.710
Angry! [grunts]

13:17.540 --> 13:18.670
[Takemichi] <i>Oh, shit!</i>

13:18.750 --> 13:20.460
[shouting]

13:23.300 --> 13:26.880
You lost, Mucho.

13:26.970 --> 13:28.890
Out of my way, you little shit.

13:30.010 --> 13:32.390
You don't understand a thing!

13:33.020 --> 13:34.230
[grunts]

13:37.020 --> 13:38.980
Don't let Tenjiku corrupt you too.

13:39.060 --> 13:41.690
[retching]

13:46.450 --> 13:48.450
This isn't worth getting corrupted for.

13:49.700 --> 13:51.200
I'm sure you know.

13:52.370 --> 13:55.330
Is that guy... on our side?

13:56.120 --> 13:57.290
He saved me?

13:58.370 --> 13:59.380
[Kakucho] Izana!

14:00.380 --> 14:02.130
You can punish me later for this.

14:06.010 --> 14:08.300
Thank you, Kaku-chan.

14:08.800 --> 14:10.470
Don't get the wrong idea, Takemichi.

14:11.510 --> 14:13.260
I didn't save you.

14:13.350 --> 14:14.970
[exclaims]

14:16.640 --> 14:18.940
The man I offered my life to,

14:20.020 --> 14:21.020
I will

14:22.020 --> 14:24.110
follow into hell if I have to.

14:25.360 --> 14:27.860
I'm not like I was back then, Takemichi!

14:30.200 --> 14:34.030
I am Kakucho,
the top of Tenjiku's Big Four.

14:34.740 --> 14:35.830
[grunts]

14:36.450 --> 14:37.580
[Souya] <i>He's fast!</i>

14:37.910 --> 14:39.920
<i>But I can match that speed.</i>

14:40.790 --> 14:41.790
[gasps]

14:42.330 --> 14:43.540
-[both] What?
-This guy...

14:45.550 --> 14:47.840
[grunting]

14:51.890 --> 14:53.010
[gasps]

14:55.310 --> 14:57.220
Our best guys...

14:57.310 --> 14:59.020
All with a single blow...

14:59.100 --> 15:00.810
I couldn't even see it.

15:02.100 --> 15:03.400
[Chifuyu] <i>That speed...</i>

15:03.900 --> 15:05.020
<i>Impossible!</i>

15:05.860 --> 15:07.610
[Souya] <i>His power is insane.</i>

15:07.990 --> 15:09.030
<i>I can't get up.</i>

15:09.740 --> 15:12.910
[Inui] <i>This guy's technique is phenomenal.</i>

15:13.320 --> 15:14.620
[Hakkai] <i>What just happened?</i>

15:15.450 --> 15:17.910
<i>I couldn't see it.</i>

15:18.000 --> 15:19.540
[chuckles]

15:19.620 --> 15:22.080
You should have
sent him in from the start.

15:23.080 --> 15:24.290
[scoffs]

15:25.790 --> 15:30.670
If he'll do the job of the other Big Four,
that'll do too.

15:33.010 --> 15:35.050
You're all that's left of Toman,

15:35.680 --> 15:36.680
Takemichi.

15:36.760 --> 15:38.850
[gasps]

15:40.020 --> 15:42.850
That pisses me off, Takemichi!

15:43.770 --> 15:44.770
Kaku-chan...

15:45.400 --> 15:47.320
Those jerks are cowards!

15:47.400 --> 15:50.030
They came back with even more guys!

15:50.110 --> 15:54.490
Then I will avenge you, Kaku-chan.

15:55.990 --> 15:58.450
Thanks, Takemichi.

15:58.540 --> 15:59.910
Oh.

16:00.040 --> 16:03.250
But I'll get revenge on my own.

16:04.330 --> 16:05.960
I want to get stronger!

16:08.920 --> 16:12.340
You really did get stronger, Kaku-chan.

16:14.130 --> 16:17.600
And you joined a gang of murderers.

16:18.350 --> 16:19.520
[grunts]

16:20.180 --> 16:21.730
[Takemichi] What happened to you?

16:21.810 --> 16:24.140
[groans]

16:25.900 --> 16:28.860
Of course, I'm different
than I was as a little kid.

16:32.440 --> 16:34.150
That's a hell of a scar.

16:38.660 --> 16:40.870
[both pant]

16:45.210 --> 16:47.000
[both laugh]

16:48.170 --> 16:49.670
[grunts]

16:51.090 --> 16:52.210
-Why...
-[grunts]

16:53.720 --> 16:55.430
Why, Kaku-chan?

16:55.510 --> 16:59.430
You could never understand our bond.

17:00.850 --> 17:03.770
Even if we were childhood friends…

17:03.850 --> 17:07.350
-[groans]
-…I can kill you without mercy!

17:07.900 --> 17:09.110
-Takemitchy!
-[body thuds]

17:09.190 --> 17:10.320
[groaning]

17:10.400 --> 17:11.650
Damn it!

17:12.150 --> 17:14.530
[Takemichi grunts]

17:16.820 --> 17:18.070
[gasps]

17:19.320 --> 17:20.530
[Inui] Koko...

17:21.450 --> 17:23.000
[Koko] Look, Inupi.

17:24.290 --> 17:27.420
"I saw the future
of BLACK DRAGON in Hanagaki."

17:28.830 --> 17:30.880
You so idealistically told me that.

17:31.670 --> 17:33.260
[Koko] But this is reality.

17:34.420 --> 17:35.920
Hanagaki will lose.

17:37.760 --> 17:41.310
There's nobody in Toman
besides Hanagaki who can still stand.

17:42.600 --> 17:44.180
Tenjiku will win.

17:44.270 --> 17:47.730
-[both grunt]
-Today is the end for Toman.

17:47.810 --> 17:49.190
Takemitchy!

17:49.270 --> 17:50.360
[groans]

17:50.440 --> 17:52.570
[Chifuyu] <i>Damn it. If this keeps up...</i>

17:53.280 --> 17:54.280
[groans]

17:54.360 --> 17:55.440
[gasps]

17:57.280 --> 17:59.910
[panting]

17:59.990 --> 18:01.830
[Takemichi] What the heck, Kakucho?

18:02.410 --> 18:06.210
You haven't changed a bit since back then.

18:06.290 --> 18:07.330
[gasps]

18:09.920 --> 18:11.290
That punch is…

18:12.460 --> 18:14.250
the punch of a second-grade punk.

18:16.300 --> 18:17.380
Takemitchy?

18:18.380 --> 18:19.640
Takemitchy...

18:20.800 --> 18:24.680
Koko, Hanagaki won't lose.

18:24.770 --> 18:26.430
[gasps]

18:28.690 --> 18:31.190
You haven't changed since you were a kid.

18:32.480 --> 18:36.110
-Don't make me--
-Why the heck are you in this gang?

18:40.700 --> 18:46.200
You said that Izana Kurokawa was
your hero, right?

18:48.040 --> 18:50.040
If I keep going, you'll die.

18:51.080 --> 18:54.130
He's trying to take out
his personal revenge

18:54.920 --> 18:57.420
by making two gangs fight each other.

18:58.670 --> 19:02.930
He had no problem
having his own sister Emma murdered.

19:03.300 --> 19:05.390
[Takemichi shouts]
How can you call that jerk a hero?

19:07.140 --> 19:08.770
Answer me, Kakucho!

19:11.900 --> 19:13.770
[laughs]

19:17.030 --> 19:18.440
[sighs]

19:23.740 --> 19:25.410
Yeah, that's right.

19:26.740 --> 19:29.290
Strong dudes aren't
necessarily the heroes.

19:30.960 --> 19:33.380
Right now, my hero is

19:34.590 --> 19:35.960
Izana Kurokawa.

19:38.260 --> 19:40.130
Why are you talking, Kakucho?

19:41.090 --> 19:42.720
Hurry up and end it.

19:44.090 --> 19:45.680
Is that so?

19:47.140 --> 19:49.270
[Takemichi] Then you truly have changed.

19:49.850 --> 19:51.980
I misjudged you, Kaku-chan!

19:52.060 --> 19:53.730
[grunts]

19:54.730 --> 19:57.020
[breathes heavily]

19:57.110 --> 19:58.280
[Takemichi grunts]

19:58.780 --> 20:00.110
How does he...

20:00.820 --> 20:02.990
How can that guy keep standing?

20:03.910 --> 20:06.620
[Koko] That's the guy
who finished off you dudes with one punch!

20:07.030 --> 20:09.290
[groans]

20:11.830 --> 20:13.000
Takemitchy!

20:13.080 --> 20:14.080
[Kakucho] Fall, damn it!

20:15.920 --> 20:17.380
I'll kill you!

20:17.460 --> 20:18.590
[Chifuyu] Stop!

20:18.670 --> 20:21.670
[panting]

20:28.560 --> 20:30.970
That's enough, Takemichi.

20:32.270 --> 20:33.940
Toman's lost.

20:35.440 --> 20:38.480
[Chifuyu] From the start, we never had
a chance of winning this fight.

20:38.980 --> 20:41.610
Look. There's not a single one of them…

20:43.110 --> 20:44.570
who can stand up.

20:45.610 --> 20:48.370
You did good!

20:49.490 --> 20:50.490
But...

20:51.910 --> 20:54.460
if this keeps up, you'll die.

20:54.580 --> 20:56.250
Toman will not lose!

20:56.790 --> 20:57.920
[Chifuyu gasps]

21:00.840 --> 21:02.460
As long as I am here,

21:04.220 --> 21:06.470
Toman will not lose.

21:08.050 --> 21:11.640
[surprised gasp]

21:11.720 --> 21:12.850
[soft grunt]

21:13.430 --> 21:15.060
[gasps]

21:15.640 --> 21:16.770
[both gasp]

21:20.860 --> 21:22.730
What are you waiting for, Kakucho?

21:24.400 --> 21:25.990
[Izana] Hurry up and finish him off.

21:26.780 --> 21:28.910
[breathes heavily]

21:29.660 --> 21:33.370
Kaku-chan can't defeat me.

21:33.950 --> 21:34.960
Huh?

21:36.160 --> 21:38.080
-[Takemichi] I can tell by your eyes.
-[grunts]

21:39.580 --> 21:41.840
They're wavering and unsure.

21:42.840 --> 21:46.300
He doesn't have the determination
to win even if it means dying.

21:46.380 --> 21:48.050
[breathes sharply]

21:52.640 --> 21:53.970
[Kisaki] Out of the way, Kakucho.

21:54.060 --> 21:55.350
[gasps]

21:56.520 --> 21:59.690
So do you have it, Takemitchy?

22:03.650 --> 22:07.700
Do you have the determination
to win even if it means dying?

22:07.780 --> 22:10.160
[♪ ominous music]

22:16.080 --> 22:18.170
[♪ closing theme music]

23:44.790 --> 23:46.800
Translated by Brian Athey
